      "solution": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The correct answer is <strong>option 3</strong> i.e. <strong>3025.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>55<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The last two digits of the number = 5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 25</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First two digits of the number = 5&nbsp;&times; (5 + 1) = 30</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, 55<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 3025</p>\r\n</span><span class=\"hqt\"><p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 3</strong> अर्थात <strong>3025&nbsp;</strong>है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>55<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n\r\n<p>संख्या के अंतिम दो अंक = 5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 25</p>\r\n\r\n<p>संख्या के पहले दो अंक = 4&nbsp;&times; (5 + 1) = 20</p>\r\n\r\n<p>अतः, 55<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 3025</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--></p>\r\n</span>",
