      "solution": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The correct answer is <strong>option 1</strong> i.e. <strong>8836.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>94<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Subtract the number from 100</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(100 - 94) = 6</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The last two digits of the number = 6<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 36</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Remaining digits of the number = (94 - 6) = 88</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, 94<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 8836</p>\r\n</span><span class=\"hqt\"><p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 1&nbsp;</strong>यानी <strong>8836&nbsp;</strong>है</p>\r\n\r\n<p>94<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>100 में से संख्या घटाएँ</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(100 - 94) = 6</p>\r\n\r\n<p>संख्या के अंतिम दो अंक = 6<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 36</p>\r\n\r\n<p>संख्या के शेष अंक = (94 - 6) = 88</p>\r\n\r\n<p>तो, 94<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 8836</p>\r\n</span>",
